  hearMoreName: TechnicalHearMore02
  hearMoreText: "A technically sustainable system scales smoothly as usage grows.
    Efficient architectures \u2014 such as caching, load balancing, and modular design
    \u2014 prevent energy waste and performance bottlenecks. By scaling effectively,
    the system minimizes the need for frequent hardware upgrades, reducing both costs
    and environmental impact."
